Modifications: rewritten rather than copied, with our section order, no
em-dashes and no references to sibling skills. Kept rules: read live state
only and never brief from conversation memory; anchor on the human's last
touch; decision order of Needs you, Changed while you were away and New words;
outcomes, not process; gloss each coined term at first use; fit on one screen
with drill-down offers; every claim cites a file, commit or path; read-only;
"done" means verified. The optional Next move line gives one action, why now and
done when, recommends and never executes, and names a manual command for the
user to run instead of invoking it. Added "Not for" lines naming handoff and
necromancy.
